    "forward_ranking": "Native forward queries quantize coordinates and squared distances to float. Compare double-tree ranking within8*float32 epsilon*max(1,distance_squared), a prospective arithmetic-rounding bound, not a geometric gate. Keep native neighbour choices and inherited actual1m squared gate. No widening of equation tolerances."
