  "interpretation": "Center the6DOF system at current transformed origin using the existing B transform; report translation Schur information and conditioned RHS with inherited1e-6 rotation-block regularization, seed-motion-axis projections, original units and all classes. Schur contributions are not additive; only unreduced H/g/cost partition is. No raw mixed-unit6DOF eigenvalue observability claim. No new optimizer or passive counterfactual trajectory.",
  "settings": "No change: original07/00 geometry, DiLO01 prior.03, cap100 chosen on original01, legacy field with knot.3 and intensity weight1, Huber.1, original gates/consensus. Passive selection and all controls predeclared, all previously observed KITTI development. No GT in native/probe decisions; no new scans.",
  "transport": "Complete original stdout remains private. Before measurement choose a lossless interleaving against byte-identical committed parent stdout: every extra raw line plus exact original insertion ordinal is stored in support.extra.jsonl.xz (XZ/CRC64 preset6); parent archive/source hashes and whole original stdout bytes/SHA/line counts are bound. Verify full byte reconstruction. Every added native raw byte is committed; no row/case/iteration truncation or result-dependent retention.",
  "failure_policy": "This is passive diagnosis only. On any execution, provenance, exact-control, population, finite-value, equation or transport failure preserve the actual failure and diagnose it before interpretation. No promotion gate is defined or waived. Rejected prior/reciprocal candidates remain stopped: no mask/reference/fraction/budget/field/gate retuning, production option or full candidate run. Fixed-pose equation differences do not establish object motion or full trajectory causality.",
